r" data-ref=3D"4d4c7c5f-f511-40e1-a587-cbe02e1d226d">bag is acquired at Fra=
nkfurt Airport, Check In location and routes to Security</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"804a10b17685">Analysis: notice Baggage Process is expressed =
in much more detail for Baggage Result (BPM) in comparison to Baggage Instr=
uction. In this particular case we look at an acquisition of a bag at Check=
-In with routing towards Security (L;Acquire;Route)</p>
<p local-id=3D"b46080552e4d">Also note that .R in this case is augmented da=
ta. It reflects on message type (Bag) and that this is a tracking event (in=
 particular a routing). <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d=
495461e-8358-4af0-a819-82dcac36c1d8">.R does not appear in BIX as =E2=80=9C=
internal airline data=E2=80=9D.</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"383436cbd56b">Result: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"htt=
ps://iataonline.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/IATABaggageWorkingGroup/Shared%2=
