<p local-id=3D"b582153d22f0">Semantics: deliver to Security screening proce=
ss, or acquire at Security Screening. Potential change of control (party sp=
ecialized in screening), but no change in custody</p>
<p local-id=3D"9b3419ad9771">Analysis: In 1745 the message may imply a deli=
very to screening, or an acquisition by screening party. One needs detailed=
 knowledge of parties to make proper discrimination.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5811e87206e0">Delivery would be marked as process (L;Acquire=
;Deliver), acquisition would be marked up as (L;Screen;Acquire). <span clas=
s=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"5c403e71-ecbd-4cd0-907f-f69b23c8a2f=
b">For mapping we have chosen latter interpretation as it more closely matc=
hes use case title</span>.</p>
