<p local-id=3D"cfd4a677c95c">Semantics: Artificial event for bag, derived f=
rom container event. A bag is transported (in its container) from inbound L=
ufthansa flight to outbound Delta flight (parking stand to parking stand)</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"b23317009f17">Analysis: Message is for transfer-departure pr=
ocess (T), so Delta is fetching the bag/container. The process is labeled a=
